    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have been anointed as a hunter for your tribe and possess skills few other <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Nelvaanians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nelvaanians\">Nelvaanians</a> do.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Nelvaanian\" title=\"Nelvaanian\">Nelvaanian</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> If you end your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move\" title=\"Move\">Move</a> at least 2 squares from where you started, you gain a +1 competence bonus on attacks made with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown_Weapons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown Weapons\">Thrown Weapons</a> until the end of your turn.</p>",
